chapter.v:
	This is 

	 the interpretation of each word. MENE: God has numbered your kingdom, and finished it;
 [Luke 24:49; [John 14:17]; Acts 2:4, 33 j 1 John 5:6]

	TEKEL: You 

	 have been weighed in the balances, and found wanting;
 [Luke 24:48; 1 Pet. 5:1; 2 Pet. 1:16 l Matt. 3:14; Luke 1:2; 1 John]
